+03 MINIMAL: the fewest elements allowed by the branching specification; three primary limbs, three secondary limbs each, three/four short terminal twigs per secondary. Extra-wide sky spacing, immaculate smooth graphite surfaces, almost no leaf plates, minimal hanging strands. Strongest sense of an elegant three-dimensional neural-network diagram.
+Make this visibly more minimal than the reference. Only 3 primary, 9 secondary, and 27-36 terminal twigs. Each of these real solid branches clearly embeds one wide dark glass groove facing the viewer, rather than simply a fine cyan outline. No foliage except at most two tiny frosted leaf plates. Only four long vertical optical filaments, and very few taut inter-layer connections. Open spacious branching rhythm. Output buds tiny points.
